WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.538
Taco: Something is not right.

2
00:00:04.539 --> 00:00:07.470
I don’t remember any of these things.

3
00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:11.271
Maxie: Me, neither. Where are all the people?

4
00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:13.247
Taco: I don’t

5
00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:16.309
know! I think we are on a different ship!

6
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.132
Maxie: I think you’re right!

7
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:29.134
Oh no! Where is this ship going?

8
00:00:29.135 --> 00:00:32.162
Taco: It’s okay, Maxie. Don’t cry.

9
00:00:32.163 --> 00:00:35.338
We’ll find our way home somehow.

10
00:00:35.339 --> 00:00:39.033
Maxie: I’m not crying.

11
00:00:39.034 --> 00:00:41.039
I thought it was you. Taco:

12
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.374
If it’s not me and it’s not you . . . then who’s crying?

13
00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:48.003
Voice:

14
00:00:48.004 --> 00:00:49.720
ME! Maxie and Taco:

15
00:00:49.721 --> 00:00:51.969
YIKES! Panda: Don’t go!

16
00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.618
Please! I’m so lonely!

17
00:00:54.619 --> 00:00:56.726
Maxie: Are you by

18
00:00:56.727 --> 00:00:59.056
yourself? Where are the other animals?

19
00:00:59.057 --> 00:01:02.014
Panda: There aren’t any other animals.

20
00:01:02.015 --> 00:01:07.467
I’m all alone.

21
00:01:07.468 --> 00:01:10.913
Taco: Don’t cry. We’ll be your friends.

22
00:01:10.914 --> 00:01:14.059
I’m Taco and this is Maxie.

23
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:22.204
Panda: I’m Lulu. It’s nice to meet you.

24
00:01:22.205 --> 00:01:23.913
Maxie: We’ll stay with you.

25
00:01:23.914 --> 00:01:25.707
Please stop crying.

26
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:30.027
Lulu: I can’t! I’m so sad!

27
00:01:30.028 --> 00:01:32.469
Maxie: Why are you sad?

28
00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:34.807
Lulu: When I was in

29
00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:40.201
China, every night I would look outside at the stars and go to

30
00:01:40.202 --> 00:01:44.010
sleep. Now, I can’t see any stars.

31
00:01:44.011 --> 00:01:50.921
I’m so sad! Taco:

32
00:01:50.922 --> 00:01:54.409
There, there. Please stop crying.

33
00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:59.056
If you can see some stars, will you be happy again? Lulu:

34
00:01:59.057 --> 00:02:04.619
But I’m inside this cage and I’m inside this ship.

35
00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.937
How can I see the stars?

36
00:02:07.938 --> 00:02:14.106
Maxie: Don’t worry. Just close your eyes.

37
00:02:14.107 --> 00:02:17.256
Taco: Maxie! What are you planning to

38
00:02:17.257 --> 00:02:18.906
do? There’s a storm outside.

39
00:02:18.907 --> 00:02:21.188
She can’t see stars tonight! Maxie:

40
00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:27.379
Taco, you should know better by now.

41
00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:33.359
Okay, Lulu, you can open your eyes now. Lulu:

42
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:37.486
Oh, look at the stars!

43
00:02:37.487 --> 00:02:44.521
It’s amazing! Just like in China! Taco:

44
00:02:44.522 --> 00:02:46.684
Why are you crying now?

45
00:02:46.685 --> 00:02:53.947
Lulu: I’m crying because I’m so happy!

